.inc CoilcraftTemplates.lib

*======================================================================
* SPICE Model generated by Coilcraft
* Coilcraft Part Number : 2508-16N
* Inductance = 16nH
*======================================================================
* Model Parameters:
*   Valid Frequency Range = 1MHz-2.5GHz
*   Ambient Temperature = 25 degC
*   Inductor TLine Model
*   Use model for Frequency Domain simulations
*======================================================================
.subckt 2508-16N port1 port2 PARAMS: Cpar=0.077pF
X1 port1 port2 Model3B PARAMS:
+ R1=42
+ R2=0.216
+ C= {Cpar}
+ L_Z0=205
+ L_EL=17.5
+ L_F0=627E6
.ends 2508-16N

